This directory contains the ConvNeXt V2 adaptation used by WAM/WovenAnchor.
Local adaptations include forward_features_4 and forward_features_8 for
feature-pyramid outputs, the timm.layers import path, and a subset of the
upstream utilities. The original upstream commit of this copy was not
recorded. The LICENSE was obtained from the upstream main branch; this does
not identify the revision of the vendored Python code.

The code was relocated from src/woven_anchor/utils/convnextv2. Executable
code and model definitions were preserved during the relocation.

